<title>USA: US grand jury charges 19 in Teletek case.</title>
<headline>US grand jury charges 19 in Teletek case.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Attorney for the District of Nevada said Thursday that a federal grand jury in Las Vegas has charged 19 people in connection with alleged securities fraud involving Teletek Inc.</p>
</text>
